# Local secrets and environment overrides
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# NOTE: appsettings.Development.json IS committed on purpose. It holds only
# local-development placeholders (a localhost connection string and a throwaway
# JWT key) so that an evaluator can clone the repo and press F5 in Visual Studio
# without hand-writing configuration. No production secret is ever committed;
# real deployments override these through environment variables.

